{"id":"en_carrying-the-cowboy-s-triplets","title":"Carrying the Cowboy's Triplets","titleEn":"Carrying the Cowboy's Triplets","description":"Ella's husband Walker turns her into a political pawn, holding her comatose sister's survival over her head. One rainy night, after being drugged and delivered to a politician, she flees and finds refuge at the ranch of Cade, the mad cowboy the town dreads. A single night together changes everything: Cade becomes her fierce defender, killing the politician and repeatedly shielding her from Walker. When her pregnancy with triplets comes to light, Walker vows to brand her belly. Just in time, Cade charges in on horseback, armed, breaking her chains and proving that real strength lies in having someone ready to take on the world for you. Follow the series on Dramzio.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/carrying-the-cowboys-triplets/en_US/535fc5f87e108994/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/carrying-the-cowboys-triplets/en_US/535fc5f87e108994/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Short Drama","Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dldw8/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_carrying-the-cowboy-s-triplets_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dldw8/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_carrying-the-cowboy-s-triplets_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dldw8/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_carrying-the-cowboy-s-triplets_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dldw8/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_carrying-the-cowbo